citation:
We will share personal information with affiliates and companies, organizations or individuals outside of VirusTotal if we believe that access, use, preservation or disclosure of the information is reasonably necessary to: 
- meet any applicable law, regulation, legal process or enforceable governmental request; 
- enforce applicable Terms of Service, including investigation of potential violations; 
- detect, prevent, or otherwise address fraud, security or technical issues, or 
- protect against harm to the rights, property or safety of VirusTotal, our affiliates, users or the public as required or permitted by law.

